{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"十有三年春，齊師伐莒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"夏，楚子伐宋。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"秋，螽。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"冬，晉殺其大夫先縠。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"十三年春，齊師伐莒，莒恃晉而不事齊故也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"夏，楚子伐宋，以其救蕭也。君子曰：「清丘之盟，唯宋可以免焉。」","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"秋，赤狄伐晉，及清，先縠召之也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"冬，晉人討邲之敗與清之師，歸罪於先縠而殺之，盡滅其族。君子曰：「惡之來也，己則取之，其先縠之謂乎！」","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_127_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_127","textTraditional":"清丘之盟，晉以衛之救陳也，討焉。使人弗去，曰：「罪無所歸，將加而師。」孔達曰：「苟利社稷，請以我說，罪我之由。我則為政，而亢大國之討，將以誰任？我則死之。」","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}